{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15344310","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15344310","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1534431001:0":{"text":"ヤクボルのプライドを見せるんだ！一番奥の茂みに、震えながら隠れてる場合じゃない！","source_cn":"拿出点雅库伯尔的气概来！别哆哆嗦嗦地躲在树丛最里面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD792C1DEDB3FF16F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1534431002:0":{"text":"ロバスト、あなたって本当に頼りになるね！","source_cn":"壮，你真可靠！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0232E49454A94109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1534431003:0":{"text":"自分が怖くて仕方ないから、必死で茂みに隠れてるくせに……","source_cn":"明明自己怕得要死，拼命往树丛里躲……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3A53390166C6D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1534431004:0":{"text":"まずいよ……怪談の記録だと僕らはもう死人の世界に入ってて、儀式をすればキャンプに戻れるって……","source_cn":"不对啊，按照恐怖故事的记录，我们应该已经进入死人的世界...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x474E14EBBE3F5EC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1534431005:0":{"text":"なんだ、そのデタラメ話は？","source_cn":"什么乱七八糟的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72BACC692D6CE78D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1534431006:0":{"text":"デタラメなんかじゃない。愛好会の文書を覚えてるんだ！第三篇の十八ページ、六行目に書いてあるんだよ！","source_cn":"我没乱说，协会里的一篇文章我都记得很清楚！在第三篇第十...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD14E5BA241299600","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1534431007:0":{"text":"やめろってば！！！とにかく、今はもう狩猟神の神殿に来たんだ……どうすればいいんだ？","source_cn":"停！！！事实上现在我们跑到狩猎神殿了，你们说该怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C946962594F8D97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1534431008:0":{"text":"ま、まさか……呪い……みたいなものが……ぎゃあっ！いやだ、死にたくない……！","source_cn":"难……难道是，诅咒……什么的……啊啊啊！不要，我不想死……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x696DD9FB22092827","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1534431009:1":{"text":"なんで俺が、こんなことに付き合わなきゃいけないんだ……","source_cn":"我到底为什么要陪你们过来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DE2081D18F9F11E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1534431009":{"text":"なんで俺が、こんなことに付き合わなきゃいけないんだ……","source_cn":"我到底为什么要陪你们过来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DE2081D18F9F11E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1534431010:1":{"t